        },
        "text_6ba8CR": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At Milano Jewelry, every diamond—lab-grown or natural—is selected with a focus on quality, certification, and craftsmanship.</p><p>We offer:</p><ul><li>Certified diamonds (IGI and GIA)<br/></li><li><a href=\"https://www.milanojewelry.com/pages/our-factory\" title=\"https://www.milanojewelry.com/pages/our-factory\">Transparent pricing </a>through direct sourcing and manufacturing<br/></li><li><a href=\"https://www.milanojewelry.com/pages/create-your-custom-jewelry\" title=\"https://www.milanojewelry.com/pages/create-your-custom-jewelry\">Customization options </a>across designs<br/></li><li>Dedicated<a href=\"https://www.milanojewelry.com/pages/contact\" title=\"https://www.milanojewelry.com/pages/contact\"> customer support</a> and after-sales service<br/></li></ul><p>Our goal is to provide clarity at every stage, so your purchase is guided by confidence and trust.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
