          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Diamonds represent a balance of natural science, craftsmanship, and design. Whether formed over billions of years or created using modern technology, their core characteristics remain the same.</p><p>Understanding the differences between types of diamonds allows for a more informed and confident purchase—one that aligns with both personal preference and long-term expectations.</p>",
